### Open missed calls, newest first
POST http://localhost:8080/api/missed-calls/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "status": "NEW" }

### Take one
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/missed-calls/1/assign
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "userId": 2 }

### Call back — rings my softphone first, then the caller
POST http://localhost:8080/api/missed-calls/1/call-back
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Close with a note
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/missed-calls/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "status": "RESOLVED", "note": "Mijoz o'zi qayta qo'ng'iroq qildi" }
